From b34c689167993f473afd2a63ff2c5fe955d49379 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tsetsen-erdene Ganbaatar <dis446@yahoo.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:09:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(app-core): harden project-tool loading and execution

Bound tools.json reads to regular files and size/tool/description/schema limits, reject unknown fields and malformed properties/required, preserve stderr on failed output, and honour graceful shutdown for running project tools. Warn when a late MCP registration replaces a project tool.

Use the resumed session's saved working directory for jcode run, and register project tools in ambient resumed, scheduled-child, and global-only session-less paths.
